                  "text": "Zab 118:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum awacu iwu kumae, Ugambre kawono wubinena kendo ngo, cil ma wubiwacu ko kumae, Mugisa ni ng’atu m’ubino ku nying Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
